    oe:aboutDisease oed:multiple_sclerosis ;
    oe:answerText "Multiple sclerosis (MS) progresses through brain region-specific inflammation and degeneration, with poorly defined mechanisms. In individuals with MS, we identified increased expression of formyl peptide receptor 1 (FPR1) in central nervous system (CNS)-resident microglia and CNS-infiltrating macrophages."^^xsd:string ;
